  "description": "<h4 data-end=\"103\" data-start=\"70\"><strong data-end=\"101\" data-start=\"75\">🖤 Brand Introduction:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"458\" data-start=\"104\"><strong data-end=\"117\" data-start=\"104\">MyMokondo</strong> is a bold, high-fashion <strong data-end=\"166\" data-start=\"142\">ON TOP AND UNDERWEAR</strong> accessories brand designed to <strong data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"197\">empower confidence and sensuality</strong>. Our pieces fuse <strong data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"252\">edgy, statement-making style</strong> with <strong data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"290\">versatile elegance</strong>, allowing women to express themselves freely&mdash;whether layered over clothing for a daring look or worn underneath as a secret confidence booster.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"460\">We are redefining the boundaries of <strong data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"496\">sensual fashion</strong>, making every woman feel <strong data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"541\">strong, fearless, and unapologetically herself</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"599\" data-start=\"596\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"601\"><strong data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"605\">🔥 Product Description:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1036\" data-start=\"635\">Our collection features <strong data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"659\">bold fashion accessories</strong> designed to be worn both <strong data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"713\">on top of outfits or as underwear accents</strong><br data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"854\">Every MyMokondo piece is a <strong data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1065\">statement of power, confidence, and individuality</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1126\" data-start=\"1123\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"1128\"><strong data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1132\">💎 USP (Unique Selling Points):</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1575\" data-start=\"1170\">✔ <strong data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1172\">ON TOP &amp; UNDERWEAR</strong> &ndash; Versatile pieces designed to be styled boldly or discreetly.<br data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1257\">✔ <strong data-end=\"1283\" data-start=\"1262\">High-Fashion Edge</strong> &ndash; Luxury-quality, fashion-forward designs that stand out.<br data-end=\"1344\" data-start=\"1341\">✔ <strong data-end=\"1366\" data-start=\"1346\">Empowering Women</strong> &ndash; Not just accessories, but confidence-boosting tools.<br data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1421\">✔ <strong data-end=\"1461\" data-start=\"1426\">Exclusive Limited-Edition Drops</strong> &ndash; Unique, hand-crafted designs.<br data-end=\"1496\" data-start=\"1493\">✔ <strong data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1498\">Premium Quality Materials</strong> &ndash; Durable, comfortable, and statement-worthy.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1580\" data-start=\"1577\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1609\" data-start=\"1582\"><strong data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1586\">💰 Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1930\" data-start=\"1610\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1712\" data-start=\"1610\"><strong data-end=\"1638\" data-start=\"1612\">Affiliate Commissions:</strong> Competitive <strong data-end=\"1665\" data-start=\"1651\">% per sale</strong> (based on sales volume &amp; partnership level).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1713\"><strong data-end=\"1770\" data-start=\"1715\">Payments via PayPal, Bank Transfer, or Store Credit</strong> (depending on preference).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1867\" data-start=\"1800\"><strong data-end=\"1819\" data-start=\"1802\">Payout Cycle:</strong> Bi-weekly or monthly based on affiliate tier.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1930\" data-start=\"1868\"><strong data-end=\"1897\" data-start=\"1870\">Custom Commission Rates</strong> for top-performing affiliates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1935\" data-start=\"1932\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1968\" data-start=\"1937\"><strong data-end=\"1966\" data-start=\"1941\">📌 Other Information:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2531\" data-start=\"1969\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2218\" data-start=\"1969\"